SUMMARY:Hairspray at Fulton Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Change the world\, one dance step at a time!\n\nYou can’t stop the beat in this big and bold musical about one girl’s inspiring dream to dance. The 1950s are out\, and change is in the air! Hairspray\, winner of eight Tony Awards\, including Best Musical\, is a family-friendly musical\, piled bouffant-high with laughter\, romance and deliriously tuneful songs. \nContent Guide \nApproximate Typical Runtime: 2hrs 30min with intermission \n\n\n\nCome Explore Our Lancaster Theaters and the Arts\n\n\nLive Theater\nLive Entertainment\nLive Music\n\n\n\nDinner Theaters\nMurder Mysteries\nThings To Do\n\n\n\nArtisan Collectives\nArt Galleries\nEvents Calendar
