SUMMARY:Leslie Odom\, Jr. at American Music Theatre
DESCRIPTION:A multifaceted Tony® and GRAMMY® Award–winning performer\, Leslie Odom\, Jr. has captivated audiences across stage\, screen\, and music. Best known for originating the role of Aaron Burr in the smash hit Hamilton\, Odom’s soaring vocals and magnetic presence earned him Broadway’s highest honors. His acclaimed recordings – including Mr.\, Simply Christmas\, and his latest chart-topping releases – spotlight his smooth blend of jazz\, soul\, and timeless pop. \nFrom Broadway favorites and soulful standards to original music that stirs the heart\, Leslie Odom\, Jr. delivers an unforgettable evening of elegance\, emotion\, and extraordinary artistry. Join us for a night that will leave you inspired long after the final note. \n\nCome Explore Our Lancaster Theaters and the Arts\n\n\nLive Theater\nLive Entertainment\nLive Music\n\n\n\nDinner Theaters\nMurder Mysteries\nThings To Do\n\n\n\nArtisan Collectives\nArt Galleries\nEvents Calendar
